---
---

<section class="section-container" id="servicios">
  <div class="section-header">
    <div class="badge badge-gold">Servicios Especializados</div>
    <h2>Soluciones de <span class="text-gradient-gold">Alto Impacto</span> para Escalar tu Marca</h2>
    <p>Desde la producción audiovisual hasta la conversión de leads: cubrimos todo el ecosistema de tu presencia digital.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="services-grid">
    <!-- Service 1 -->
    <div class="service-card glass-panel">
      <div class="service-icon gold">
        <svg width="32" height="32" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
          <polygon points="12 2 15.09 8.26 22 9.27 17 14.14 18.18 21.02 12 17.77 5.82 21.02 7 14.14 2 9.27 8.91 8.26 12 2"></polygon>
        </svg>
      </div>
      <h3>Marca Personal 360° (Done For You)</h3>
      <p>Nos encargamos de toda la estrategia, dirección creativa, guiones y gestión general para que solo te preocupes por grabar y cerrar clientes.</p>
      
      <div class="service-features">
        <div class="feature-tag">Estrategia de Contenido</div>
        <div class="feature-tag">Copywriting de Autoridad</div>
        <div class="feature-tag">Gestión Redes Sociales</div>
        <div class="feature-tag">Optimización de Perfiles</div>
      </div>

      <a href="#contacto" class="service-link">
        <span>Saber más sobre 360°</span>
        <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7"></path></svg>
      </a>
    </div>

    <!-- Service 2 -->
    <div class="service-card glass-panel">
      <div class="service-icon cyan">
        <svg width="32" height="32" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
          <polygon points="23 7 16 12 23 17 23 7"></polygon>
          <rect x="1" y="5" width="15" height="14" rx="2" ry="2"></rect>
        </svg>
      </div>
      <h3>Fábrica de Vídeo Viral (Reels & Shorts)</h3>
      <p>Edición dinámicas de clase mundial, efectos cinematográficos y subtítulos enganchantes diseñados para captar atención en los primeros 3 segundos.</p>
      
      <div class="service-features">
        <div class="feature-tag">Edición Estilo Alex Hormozi</div>
        <div class="feature-tag">Efectos Sound Design</div>
        <div class="feature-tag">B-roll Curado</div>
        <div class="feature-tag">Adaptación Multiformato</div>
      </div>

      <a href="#contacto" class="service-link">
        <span>Ver ejemplos de vídeo</span>
        <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7"></path></svg>
      </a>
    </div>

    <!-- Service 3 -->
    <div class="service-card glass-panel">
      <div class="service-icon purple">
        <svg width="32" height="32" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
          <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle>
          <path d="M16 12l-4-4-4 4M12 16V8"></path>
        </svg>
      </div>
      <h3>Growth Paid Ads (Seguidores Reales)</h3>
      <p>Aceleramos el crecimiento de tu comunidad mediante campañas hiper-segmentadas de anuncios dirigidas exactamente a tu público objetivo ideal.</p>
      
      <div class="service-features">
        <div class="feature-tag">Meta Ads & TikTok Ads</div>
        <div class="feature-tag">A/B Testing Continuo</div>
        <div class="feature-tag">0% Bots / 100% Reales</div>
        <div class="feature-tag">Lead Generation B2B</div>
      </div>

      <a href="#contacto" class="service-link">
        <span>Cotizar campaña de Ads</span>
        <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7"></path></svg>
      </a>
    </div>

    <!-- Service 4 -->
    <div class="service-card glass-panel">
      <div class="service-icon gold">
        <svg width="32" height="32" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
          <rect x="2" y="3" width="20" height="14" rx="2" ry="2"></rect>
          <line x1="8" y1="21" x2="16" y2="21"></line>
          <line x1="12" y1="17" x2="12" y2="21"></line>
        </svg>
      </div>
      <h3>Funnels High-Ticket & VSL System</h3>
      <p>Construimos el embudo de ventas que transforma la curiosidad de tus seguidores en llamadas de agendamiento y cierres de contratos de alto valor.</p>
      
      <div class="service-features">
        <div class="feature-tag">Video Sales Letters (VSL)</div>
        <div class="feature-tag">Agendamiento Calendar</div>
        <div class="feature-tag">Secuencias de Email/WA</div>
        <div class="feature-tag">CRM Integration</div>
      </div>

      <a href="#contacto" class="service-link">
        <span>Construir mi Funnel</span>
        <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7"></path></svg>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .services-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));
    gap: 30px;
  }

  .service-card {
    padding: 36px 30px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
    transition: all 0.3s ease;
  }

  .service-card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-8px);
    border-color: rgba(0, 242, 254, 0.3);
    box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.6), 0 0 25px rgba(0, 242, 254, 0.1);
  }

  .service-icon {
    width: 64px;
    height: 64px;
    border-radius: 18px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }

  .service-icon.gold {
    background: rgba(226, 184, 89, 0.12);
    color: var(--accent-gold);
    border: 1px solid rgba(226, 184, 89, 0.3);
  }

  .service-icon.cyan {
    background: rgba(0, 242, 254, 0.12);
    color: var(--accent-cyan);
    border: 1px solid rgba(0, 242, 254, 0.3);
  }

  .service-icon.purple {
    background: rgba(157, 78, 221, 0.12);
    color: var(--accent-purple);
    border: 1px solid rgba(157, 78, 221, 0.3);
  }

  .service-card h3 {
    font-size: 1.4rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }

  .service-card p {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }

  .service-features {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 8px;
    margin-bottom: 30px;
    margin-top: auto;
  }

  .feature-tag {
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    padding: 5px 12px;
    border-radius: 20px;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
    color: var(--text-main);
  }

  .service-link {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 0.92rem;
    color: var(--accent-gold);
    transition: gap 0.2s ease;
  }

  .service-link:hover {
    gap: 14px;
    color: #ffffff;
  }
</style>
